description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":345,"closed_issues":2336,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:21:32Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-10-14T18:20:30Z","updated_at":"2026-10-15T12:25:44Z","closed_at":"2026-10-15T12:25:38Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124484","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124484","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124484.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124484.patch","merged_at":"2026-10-15T12:25:38Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\nIn #124336, the change left the particle material uniform block assigned to binding 2, while C++ now binds it to binding 1.\r\n\r\n### Additional Details\r\nIn #124336, `drivers/gles3/storage/particles_storage.h‎` was updated, since the global shader parameters were moving into a texture and no longer needed a dedicated UBO:\r\n```\r\n enum ParticlesUniformLocation {\r\n     PARTICLES_FRAME_UNIFORM_LOCATION,\r\n-    PARTICLES_GLOBALS_UNIFORM_LOCATION,\r\n     PARTICLES_MATERIAL_UNIFORM_LOCATION,\r\n };\r\n```\r\nAs a result of this change, the `PARTICLES_MATERIAL_UNIFORM_LOCATION` binding was changed from 2 to 1.\r\n\r\nThe PR correctly removed the global uniform buffer in `‎drivers/gles3/shaders/particles.glsl`:\r\n```\r\n-layout(std140) uniform GlobalShaderUniformData { //ubo:1\r\n-    vec4 global_shader_uniforms[MAX_GLOBAL_SHADER_UNIFORMS];\r\n-};\r\n+uniform highp sampler2D global_shader_parameters_texture; //texunit:-2\r\n```\r\nHowever, the UBO binding for the material uniform was left unchanged:\r\n```\r\n#ifdef MATERIAL_UNIFORMS_USED\r\nlayout(std140) uniform MaterialUniforms{ //ubo:2\r\n\r\n#MATERIAL_UNIFORMS\r\n\r\n};\r\n#endif\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n## Summary of changes\r\nIn `drivers\\gles3\\shaders\\particles.glsl`, Change this line from:\r\n```layout(std140) uniform MaterialUniforms{ //ubo:2```\r\nTo:\r\n```layout(std140) uniform MaterialUniforms{ //ubo:1```\r\n\r\n## AI Usage Disclosure\r\nChatGPT assisted with investigation and analysis.\r\nTesting was done by a human. No agents were used.\r\n\r\n## Related Issues\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124336 -- The PR that introduced the uniform-binding regression.\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112926 -- Separate SDF collision bug that requires this fix.\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124484/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124484/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}